# RESTLESS: a tap shoots at once; holding the button charges, and letting
# go after 40 frames looses the charged shot (staff: faster and a little
# farther).
game restless
wait 5
cheat half 0
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat god
hold A 30
release
wait 1
expect shots == 0
expect fired == 1
hold A 45
expect charge >= 40
release
wait 1
expect shot0_charged == 1
expect shot0_vx == 1408
expect fired == 3
